  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/IMG_4809.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La cafeter&iacute;a Druida de Onda, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45, expone desde este viernes al domingo 31 de mayo la&nbsp;muestra &#39;Picaportes&#39;, una serie de 14 fotograf&iacute;as de Vicent Ballester donde se muestran al detalle estos elementos antiguos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4793.jpg\" alt=\"img_4793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4795.jpg\" alt=\"img_4795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4797.jpg\" alt=\"img_4797\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4800.jpg\" alt=\"img_4800\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4801.jpg\" alt=\"img_4801\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4804.jpg\" alt=\"img_4804\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4807.jpg\" alt=\"img_4807\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoforrellatsdruida/img_4809.jpg\" alt=\"img_4809\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
